Z||000001||terryk||09-26-1999||11:05 PM||||The phantom wipes at start up is a traditional GM wiper problem. Adjusting the park position will sometimes fix it, otherwise a new motor is needed.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Patrick||09-27-1999||03:36 PM||||<BR>Hmmm... I know you're just kidding around Terry, but just in case anyone thinks you're serious, I've gotta put in my two cents(Cdn) worth. <P>My parents and myself have had <B>seven</B> different <B>GM</B> vehicles since 1960, and not one car has had a problem with the wipers. And living here on the west coast in Vancouver, we use our wipers one heck of a lot!<P>I just didn't want any Ford or Mopar fans getting too cocky.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||14
