Z||000005||David||09-28-1999||05:28 PM||||Cast my vote that only the Fiero does this.  I've had GM cars for years, and none has had any wiper problem.  My '86 Fiero though will randomly make one wipe.  No pattern in when it does it.  The problem is not worth much effort in trying to fix.  I'll just live with it.||||reg||1
Z||000006||batboy||09-28-1999||10:01 PM||||I've had goofy wiper problems with my 86 Suburban and one of my Fieros. Never any problems with any of the many other GM vehicles I've had or have, including my other two Fieros.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Dave85||10-01-1999||11:02 PM||||My "Phantom Wipe" problen has been fixed--I think. I finaly had to replace my dying battery and now my problem is gone!! It was worse then ever before the replacement.||||reg||1
